WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:34.806
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:35.076 --> 00:36.286
Are you okay?

3
00:36.369 --> 00:39.330
Yes, Mikoy. I'm just really, really happy.

4
00:39.414 --> 00:42.125
Because my son is here with me,

5
00:42.208 --> 00:44.002
along with my daughter.

6
00:45.754 --> 00:47.922
It's a good thing the world is small.

7
00:50.467 --> 00:52.010
Sen, look.

8
00:52.093 --> 00:53.303
Oh.

9
00:53.386 --> 00:56.389
If this works on Chiara, well and good.

10
00:56.473 --> 00:58.850
If it doesn't, we still have Donabel.

11
01:01.936 --> 01:03.021
Ouch, that hurts.

12
01:04.898 --> 01:05.899
It's time, Chiara.

13
01:05.982 --> 01:08.860
It's time for you to lead the Concordat.

14
01:10.445 --> 01:11.780
Whatever you have here,

15
01:11.863 --> 01:13.364
you need to leave it all behind,

16
01:13.448 --> 01:14.949
as soon as possible.

17
01:23.249 --> 01:24.918
In-law, is Chiara there?

18
01:25.001 --> 01:27.545
Of course. It's her bridal shower tonight.

19
01:27.629 --> 01:29.422
I just wanted to check on her.

20
01:29.506 --> 01:31.758
She's excited about her wedding.

21
01:31.841 --> 01:33.301
That's good to hear.

22
01:33.384 --> 01:36.346
Okay, in-law. Thank you so much. Take care over there. Good night.

23
01:36.429 --> 01:37.347
Wait, I have something--

24
01:44.687 --> 01:48.399
Let's do a question-and-answer round so we can really get to know each other.

25
01:48.483 --> 01:51.569
Okay!

26
01:51.653 --> 01:54.030
Who can drink the most?

27
02:02.122 --> 02:04.582
-Definitely you. -Wow, unbelievable.

28
02:07.210 --> 02:08.044
She can really drink!

29
02:08.128 --> 02:09.379
Here's the question.

30
02:09.462 --> 02:11.923
Who kissed first?

31
02:12.006 --> 02:13.091
Who was it?

32
02:13.174 --> 02:14.676
-Oh. -Who?

33
02:20.265 --> 02:21.391
-Who? -Who among you?

34
02:21.975 --> 02:22.976
You!

35
02:24.269 --> 02:25.145
It was me.

36
02:27.522 --> 02:28.773
Bro, you're really handsome.

37
02:28.857 --> 02:30.233
You're really something!

38
02:30.316 --> 02:31.109
Right in Prague!

39
02:31.192 --> 02:33.236
You're one of a kind, Mikoy!

40
02:33.319 --> 02:35.738
Who fell in love first?

41
02:59.220 --> 03:00.930
It was me. I'll admit it.

42
03:01.014 --> 03:02.140
-That's me. -The lover boy!

43
03:02.223 --> 03:04.934
-Yes, that's me. -Lover boy!

44
03:05.018 --> 03:06.394
Seriously?

45
03:06.477 --> 03:08.646
Who fell harder?

46
03:09.564 --> 03:10.481
The truth.

47
03:19.824 --> 03:20.783
I think I did.

48
03:24.954 --> 03:27.707
Okay, this is it. This is the hardest one.

49
03:27.790 --> 03:31.044
Who's the messier one?

50
03:31.127 --> 03:32.921
This one is salty! This one!

51
03:33.004 --> 03:34.047
Salty.

52
03:34.672 --> 03:35.506
No!

53
03:35.590 --> 03:36.966
Messy!

54
03:37.050 --> 03:38.968
That's the salty one!

55
03:39.510 --> 03:40.511
Salty?

56
03:40.595 --> 03:43.848
Mikoy is the messy one.

57
03:44.474 --> 03:46.976
I'm the messy one.

58
03:47.060 --> 03:48.645
Yes, that's me.

59
03:48.728 --> 03:50.355
Wait, why me?

60
03:50.438 --> 03:51.940
It's my turn to ask…

61
03:52.023 --> 03:53.399
That's really me!

62
03:53.483 --> 03:55.693
Chiara and Mikoy.

63
03:55.777 --> 03:56.819
Opposite!

64
03:57.570 --> 04:00.698
-Chiara and Mikoy. -Chiara!

65
04:02.033 --> 04:04.994
Who kissed first?

66
04:06.788 --> 04:08.998
Whoa! You're the man!

67
04:09.082 --> 04:10.667
He already asked that.

68
04:10.750 --> 04:12.085
Did you already ask that?

69
04:13.878 --> 04:17.090
Who closed their eyes first when they kissed?

70
04:20.885 --> 04:22.345
You!

71
04:24.764 --> 04:26.891
Why did you close your eyes?

72
04:36.067 --> 04:38.319
That dried fish smells so good. I've missed this.

73
04:38.403 --> 04:39.237
-Why? -Yes!

74
04:39.320 --> 04:41.489
We're not allowed to cook this in our condo.

75
04:42.824 --> 04:44.117
It's so good.

76
04:45.076 --> 04:46.577
Angelito.

77
04:48.913 --> 04:51.916
Make yourself some coffee first so you can get nervous about

78
04:52.000 --> 04:54.335
what you did last night.

79
04:56.129 --> 04:57.213
Wow, Angelito.

80
04:57.297 --> 04:59.132
We never knew you were like that.

81
05:00.883 --> 05:02.260
Like what?

82
05:02.343 --> 05:03.177
Hey!

83
05:03.261 --> 05:04.387
What?

84
05:04.470 --> 05:06.431
Don't play innocent!

85
05:07.432 --> 05:09.267
What are you guys talking about?

86
05:14.897 --> 05:16.024
Huh!

87
05:18.484 --> 05:20.069
Can we talk?

88
05:29.912 --> 05:31.664
Then let's talk!

89
05:32.498 --> 05:34.167
What do you want to talk about?

90
05:35.001 --> 05:36.169
You know,

91
05:37.378 --> 05:38.796
I'm pissed at you.

92
05:39.505 --> 05:41.674
You think you're the only one?

93
05:41.758 --> 05:42.633
Huh?

94
05:43.593 --> 05:44.969
Me too.

95
05:46.262 --> 05:47.388
But you know,

96
05:48.765 --> 05:50.767
even though I'm pissed at you,

97
05:51.934 --> 05:53.478
I still want to talk to you.

98
05:54.687 --> 05:55.646
Huh?

99
05:56.981 --> 05:58.107
Me too.

100
05:58.941 --> 06:01.652
Even though every time I get close to you,

101
06:02.153 --> 06:04.822
I get so damn annoyed.

102
06:04.906 --> 06:06.324
Because…

103
06:08.409 --> 06:09.786
you're an idiot!

104
06:15.416 --> 06:16.459
Yes, I am.

105
06:17.043 --> 06:18.252
I'm an idiot.

106
06:20.171 --> 06:22.381
But… But…

107
06:24.634 --> 06:25.885
I have a crush on you.

108
06:27.136 --> 06:28.179
Really?

109
06:29.639 --> 06:30.848
Yes.

110
06:32.725 --> 06:33.810
You?

111
06:38.731 --> 06:40.066
You're an idiot too!

112
06:40.149 --> 06:41.317
Ow.

113
06:43.402 --> 06:44.904
Because

114
06:45.571 --> 06:47.281
I have a crush on you too.

115
06:50.993 --> 06:56.207
So, we have a mutual crush, then?

116
07:00.461 --> 07:02.797
-Like that? -Yes.

117
07:05.299 --> 07:07.969
Mutual crush backing, padlock and key.

118
07:08.970 --> 07:11.347
Look at you, coming up with stuff like that.

119
07:13.933 --> 07:15.768
-Let's go back there. -Cheers.

120
07:17.770 --> 07:19.272
Ow, ow, easy, easy.

121
07:19.355 --> 07:20.606
Easy.

122
07:35.204 --> 07:37.039
Is that how you eat in the condo?

123
07:37.123 --> 07:39.250
Even with dried fish, you still use a spoon and fork?

124
07:39.333 --> 07:40.543
We don't have a condo.

125
07:40.626 --> 07:42.003
The eggs are so good.

126
07:47.008 --> 07:48.301
Ow.

127
07:52.430 --> 07:55.224
Dekyo's mix is seriously lethal.

128
07:55.308 --> 07:56.642
It hurts!

129
08:03.357 --> 08:04.859
Ow.

130
08:13.201 --> 08:14.577
Oh my gosh.

131
08:17.705 --> 08:18.915
Huh?

132
08:18.998 --> 08:19.957
What's this?

133
08:28.883 --> 08:29.926
What?

134
08:30.468 --> 08:31.928
Congratulations for what?

135
08:33.304 --> 08:34.847
You don't remember?

136
08:45.566 --> 08:47.109
Angelito.

137
08:47.193 --> 08:48.653
Just a moment, Father.

138
08:48.736 --> 08:50.655
Don't leave yet.

139
08:52.031 --> 08:53.199
Let me borrow this first.

140
08:55.535 --> 08:57.745
Wow!

141
08:57.828 --> 09:00.206
-All set, Father. -Okay.

142
09:01.415 --> 09:02.667
Angelito.

143
09:03.167 --> 09:04.919
Do you accept Sofie,

144
09:05.711 --> 09:09.966
even though she eats all the food in the fridge?

145
09:11.092 --> 09:13.010
There.

146
09:17.431 --> 09:18.933
Good man!

147
09:20.560 --> 09:22.019
And you, Sofie,

148
09:22.603 --> 09:24.230
do you accept Angelito,

149
09:24.897 --> 09:28.859
even though he sometimes smells like sunshine?

150
09:37.159 --> 09:38.160
That's mine!

151
09:40.288 --> 09:41.956
In that case,

152
09:42.039 --> 09:43.666
I now pronounce you

153
09:43.749 --> 09:45.418
husband and wife.

154
09:51.048 --> 09:52.633
Kiss her already!

155
09:52.717 --> 09:54.927
Kiss her!

156
09:55.511 --> 09:56.721
Kiss her!

157
10:27.418 --> 10:30.755
And for today's episode, of course, Mikoy and I are gonna play

158
10:30.838 --> 10:32.673
1v1!

159
10:34.050 --> 10:36.052
-Ball. -Your turn.

160
10:37.219 --> 10:38.471
I'll film you guys. I'll film you guys.

161
10:38.554 --> 10:39.764
You film us, Jen-Jen.

162
10:39.847 --> 10:41.891
-Are you ready, Mikoy? -Let's go!

163
10:41.974 --> 10:43.684
Defense!

164
10:43.768 --> 10:45.186
Mikoy, you got this!

165
10:48.439 --> 10:50.483
-Hey, my ball. -Brick!

166
10:51.025 --> 10:53.527
-One point, one point. -What do you mean, one point?

167
10:53.611 --> 10:54.528
That's my score. That's my score.

168
10:54.612 --> 10:56.072
It was out!

169
10:56.656 --> 10:57.698
I got one point!

170
10:57.782 --> 10:58.741
A point for the brick.

171
10:58.824 --> 11:00.826
Fine, fine. One point it is.

172
11:00.910 --> 11:01.827
One point. I got one point.

173
11:01.911 --> 11:03.663
Hey, Angelito!

174
11:03.746 --> 11:04.622
-Come here. -Bro.

175
11:04.705 --> 11:05.539
Angelito's here.

176
11:05.623 --> 11:07.208
Come help us.

177
11:07.291 --> 11:08.751
What's up? Where?

178
11:08.834 --> 11:11.003
With what? Being handsome.

179
11:11.087 --> 11:12.797
Doesn't seem necessary.

180
11:12.880 --> 11:14.507
See?

181
11:14.590 --> 11:15.841
Film it, film it.

182
11:15.925 --> 11:18.094
How are we supposed to play basketball? We don't have a ball anymore.

183
11:18.177 --> 11:20.346
It fell down over there, into the begtu.

184
11:20.429 --> 11:21.597
Let's just make content.

185
11:21.680 --> 11:23.140
-Content? What content? -Right.

186
11:23.224 --> 11:24.058
Let's make content.

187
11:24.141 --> 11:25.893
-Content? -Let's make content.

188
11:27.186 --> 11:29.146
-You go here. Here. -Game.

189
11:29.230 --> 11:30.481
-Let's keep going. -There.

190
11:30.564 --> 11:32.024
It's simple. I'll teach you.

191
11:33.651 --> 11:34.610
Okay.

192
11:36.112 --> 11:38.697
‎Right. We can do that. Content.

193
11:38.781 --> 11:40.324
‎Let's make content.

194
11:47.164 --> 11:49.583
Why did you really come back, Mama Yaya?

195
11:51.877 --> 11:53.963
You know why I came back.

196
12:01.512 --> 12:04.515
After La Morte Bianca died,

197
12:04.598 --> 12:06.267
someone took her place.

198
12:09.895 --> 12:11.647
Rio De Janyx.

199
12:12.148 --> 12:13.691
But he's not smart.

200
12:14.442 --> 12:15.943
He's not careful.

201
12:16.569 --> 12:18.571
But he's dangerous.

202
12:31.417 --> 12:35.254
Many in the Concordat want you.

203
12:35.880 --> 12:38.591
They want you to take his place.

204
12:43.888 --> 12:46.724
But Rio De Janyx doesn't want any competition.

205
12:47.475 --> 12:51.020
And you know what they do

206
12:51.103 --> 12:53.230
to anyone they see as a threat.

207
13:01.530 --> 13:03.824
-Look what we're doing! -I'm getting the hang of it.

208
13:08.204 --> 13:09.079
No.

209
13:13.000 --> 13:16.045
I'm never going back to that world, Mama Yaya.

210
13:19.131 --> 13:20.174
Are you happy?

211
13:23.886 --> 13:25.554
This is my life now.

212
13:27.348 --> 13:28.390
But Chiara.

213
13:28.474 --> 13:29.600
Mama Yaya.

214
13:32.144 --> 13:34.271
This is what I chose.

215
13:44.740 --> 13:46.200
You know,

216
13:46.283 --> 13:50.162
I'm so grateful that you always come with me.

217
13:50.246 --> 13:51.956
You know me, of course.

218
13:52.039 --> 13:53.999
I'm getting older, but I'm still sexy.

219
13:54.083 --> 13:55.709
So naturally, I have trouble carrying things.

220
13:55.793 --> 13:57.711
You always carry them for me.

221
14:04.385 --> 14:06.387
Why are you so quiet?

222
14:06.470 --> 14:07.555
Is something wrong?

223
14:07.638 --> 14:09.473
Nothing's wrong, Mommy Tess.

224
14:09.557 --> 14:10.516
Um…

225
14:10.599 --> 14:13.227
How was the party last night?

226
14:13.310 --> 14:15.187
How come you didn't come?

227
14:15.271 --> 14:19.316
I had some things to take care of, and Mom made us go somewhere.

228
14:19.400 --> 14:22.570
You know, she's making the most of her vacation.

229
14:22.653 --> 14:25.865
Of course. That's good. The timing is perfect.

230
14:25.948 --> 14:26.907
And you know,

231
14:26.991 --> 14:29.743
I'm really happy you got to spend time with your mom.

232
14:30.995 --> 14:33.831
Yes, finally. Finally.

233
14:35.040 --> 14:37.001
I honestly don't want her to leave again.

234
14:37.793 --> 14:39.587
Of course.

235
14:39.670 --> 14:41.714
But you know what I think?

236
14:42.381 --> 14:44.842
You should invite her to the wedding.

237
14:46.468 --> 14:47.344
What?

238
14:47.928 --> 14:48.888
Of course.

239
14:48.971 --> 14:51.181
And not just because she's your mother,

240
14:51.265 --> 14:53.976
but because she's already part of our family.

241
14:54.059 --> 14:57.563
After all, she is Chiara's Mama Yaya, right?

242
14:59.273 --> 15:00.190
Really?

243
15:00.274 --> 15:02.860
Of course. What are you talking about?

244
15:02.943 --> 15:05.946
And you should tell her yourself, just to make sure she gets the invitation.

245
15:10.618 --> 15:11.577
Oh, goodness.

246
15:12.161 --> 15:14.997
Thank you, Mommy Tess. I'm sure Mom will be so happy.

247
15:15.080 --> 15:18.584
And tell her she can't escape,

248
15:18.667 --> 15:21.003
because I know she misses

249
15:21.086 --> 15:24.089
all the Filipino food we serve at celebrations, right?

250
15:24.173 --> 15:27.885
So she better eat as much as she can at the reception.

251
15:27.968 --> 15:30.346
She definitely will. You know her, Mommy Tess.

252
15:30.930 --> 15:32.514
She's actually the one who taught me

253
15:32.598 --> 15:35.267
how to wipe out entire serving trays.

254
15:35.851 --> 15:40.648
We've got plenty more trays to wipe out, so let's get going.

255
16:28.278 --> 16:32.908
Well, let's see who you're hiding, Sean.

256
17:18.662 --> 17:19.955
Babe, what are you doing here?

257
17:20.539 --> 17:22.374
I thought you were leaving ahead of me.

258
17:23.709 --> 17:25.419
You can't stay away from me.

259
17:25.502 --> 17:26.920
You missed me already.

260
17:27.463 --> 17:28.964
You can't leave me alone.

261
17:29.590 --> 17:30.841
I knew it.

262
17:39.099 --> 17:40.267
Oh.

263
17:52.446 --> 17:53.781
Babe, what is this?

264
17:55.282 --> 17:59.745
Babe, come on. Can we… Can we just talk like normal people?

265
18:00.662 --> 18:04.541
Let me go, so we can talk normally, Carlota. Please.

266
18:10.547 --> 18:11.423
Sean.

267
18:23.018 --> 18:24.103
So,

268
18:25.145 --> 18:28.065
either you come clean right now

269
18:28.148 --> 18:30.234
and tell me

270
18:30.776 --> 18:33.654
everything about the woman you've been talking to

271
18:34.863 --> 18:38.033
or I'll make sure

272
18:39.368 --> 18:41.787
you never get to cheat on anyone again.

273
18:58.387 --> 18:59.513
There.

274
19:00.639 --> 19:02.391
-There. -Okay.

275
19:02.474 --> 19:03.433
There you go.

276
19:04.726 --> 19:06.395
One, two, three. There!

277
19:06.478 --> 19:08.480
This should be good for the goofballs, sweetheart.

278
19:08.564 --> 19:09.857
Let's fix yours next.

279
19:09.940 --> 19:12.192
The ones for your bridesmaids and maid of honor.

280
19:22.578 --> 19:24.121
The world really is a small place, huh?

281
19:24.997 --> 19:27.708
Who would've thought your Mama Yaya

282
19:27.791 --> 19:29.001
would turn out to be Rahmboy's mother?

283
19:31.628 --> 19:34.131
Even I was surprised.

284
19:37.176 --> 19:38.719
By the way, sweetheart.

285
19:39.303 --> 19:43.307
How come you never told me about your Mama Yaya?

286
19:48.187 --> 19:50.397
Well, it just slipped my mind, sweetheart.

287
19:50.480 --> 19:52.399
And besides, you know,

288
19:52.482 --> 19:55.903
a lot of things happened between the two of us,

289
19:55.986 --> 20:01.366
and to be honest, I just never thought we'd see each other again.

290
20:03.869 --> 20:05.537
I'm glad you found each other again.

291
20:06.538 --> 20:07.831
Right?

292
20:11.877 --> 20:13.003
Ow.

293
20:13.086 --> 20:14.129
Ouch!

294
20:15.422 --> 20:16.840
-Sweetheart, I'm sorry. -Ow.

295
20:16.924 --> 20:17.966
I thought there was, you know,

296
20:18.050 --> 20:19.593
an insect.

297
20:19.676 --> 20:20.886
-I thought there was a bug. -A bug?

298
20:20.969 --> 20:22.804
I saw it. There it is.

299
20:23.847 --> 20:26.892
I thought you were starting to miss your violent life.

300
20:26.975 --> 20:27.935
That hurts!

301
20:30.812 --> 20:32.522
I'd never miss that.

302
20:32.606 --> 20:35.317
Really? My side seems to be telling me otherwise.

303
20:39.363 --> 20:41.365
I'm just joking, sweetheart.

304
20:42.074 --> 20:45.494
Of course, I know you're not going back to that life.

305
20:47.746 --> 20:50.832
I know. This is where we belong.

306
20:52.417 --> 20:54.378
Living the quiet life we've always dreamed of.

307
20:55.087 --> 20:55.963
Right?

308
21:01.468 --> 21:02.719
Don't stress about it, okay?

309
21:55.856 --> 21:57.024
So playful.

310
22:17.210 --> 22:19.463
So this is what having a family feels like.

311
22:20.297 --> 22:21.757
If only I could,

312
22:22.758 --> 22:25.010
I'd want things to stay this way.

313
22:26.178 --> 22:27.637
Being with them.

314
24:09.531 --> 24:11.908
And I will end anyone,

315
24:11.992 --> 24:16.955
anyone who tries to disrupt our lives again.

316
24:33.305 --> 24:34.806
Concordat.

317
24:53.950 --> 24:54.910
Are you ready?

318
24:54.993 --> 24:56.620
I hope so.

319
24:57.287 --> 25:00.916
Let's hope Viktor and Donabel make it here.

320
25:03.168 --> 25:04.419
Did you hear?

321
25:04.502 --> 25:06.379
About ma'am's husband?

322
25:06.463 --> 25:07.464
The one who used to be here.

323
25:07.547 --> 25:09.216
Viktor Valtrovi.

324
25:09.299 --> 25:10.717
Yes. It's pretty bad.

325
25:10.800 --> 25:11.676
He's so beated.

326
25:11.760 --> 25:13.553
What happened? Was there a riot?

327
25:13.637 --> 25:15.639
All I heard was that he could barely stand.

328
25:15.722 --> 25:17.015
We're screwed.

329
25:17.098 --> 25:19.100
General Norberto might find out.

330
25:22.604 --> 25:23.730
It's still unclear.

331
25:25.398 --> 25:28.068
We still don't know if there was a rumble

332
25:28.151 --> 25:30.070
or if he violated any rules in there.

333
25:30.153 --> 25:33.323
Maybe we can talk to General Norberto?

334
25:35.033 --> 25:36.368
There's an update.

335
25:38.453 --> 25:42.123
Once our dreams finally come true.

336
25:45.252 --> 25:48.046
I've found a new dream for myself.

337
25:48.129 --> 25:50.423
I've built a new life that I want.

338
25:50.507 --> 25:52.425
I held up my end, Chiara.

339
25:52.509 --> 25:54.636
It's time for you to hold up yours.
